# DEPLOY-FIX (2026-11-05): pin google-auth directly. google-genai needs
# google-auth[requests]>=2.56.0,<3.0.0 (a range); Render's pip 23.2.1 in
# --require-hashes mode resolves the range to the newest wheel (2.62.1,
# released 2026-11-03) and then errors because a range is not pinned
# with ==. Pinning 2.62.1 makes the pin match what the resolver picks.
